    "updated_at": "2015-10-30T02:00:39Z",
    "body": "Just wanted to throw the idea out there: what about overloading `setTransform` to take either a DOMMatrixInit or the long list of parameters? Generally I don't like overloads, but in this case it seems kind of nice. So on balance I don't have a preference, but I wanted to surface the idea in case you happened to like it.\n",
